---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
    title="Company, KYDE"
    description="KYDE builds the Behavioral Firewall, governance infrastructure for the agentic economy. Based in Germany. Built for industries where failure has consequences."
>
    <Navbar />

    <main>

        <!-- ══════════ HERO ══════════ -->
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-grid absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-48 md:pb-36 md:border-x md:border-[#1F1F1F]">

                <div class="mb-10">
                    <div class="flex items-end justify-between border-b border-[#1F1F1F] pb-3"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#A8A8A8]">01 · Company</span></div>
                </div>

                <h1 class="hero-h1 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-bold text-[#F2F2F2] uppercase tracking-tight md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
                    We're building the Behavioral Firewall for the most important
                     technology shift of our lifetime.
                </h1>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ══════════ BODY ══════════ -->
        <section class="relative border-t border-[#1F1F1F]">
            <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32 md:border-x md:border-[#1F1F1F]">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-8 items-start">

                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#F2F2F2]">About</p>
                        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#A8A8A8]">[KYDE]</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-8 max-w-2xl">
                        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#A8A8A8]">
                            AI will transform everything, healthcare, energy, finance, critical infrastructure, the way entire organizations operate. This isn't speculation. It's already happening.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#A8A8A8]">
                            But the path from here to AI-first enterprises runs through existing infrastructure, production systems, regulated environments, legal frameworks, and organizations built for human decision-making. Bringing autonomous agents into that world safely, verifiably, and at scale is an unsolved infrastructure problem.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#A8A8A8]">
                            That's what KYDE builds. The Behavioral Firewall, the infrastructure layer that lets organizations deploy autonomous agents into critical environments with the same rigor they apply to their networks, their keys, and their data centers. Three layers: continuous agent health scoring across five behavioral dimensions, benchmarked against the industry, real-time enforcement that restricts actions across systems and automatically quarantines low-scoring agents, and a tamper-proof record of every decision, independent of any provider.
                        </p>

                        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#1F1F1F] pl-6 py-1">
                            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#A8A8A8]">
                                We believe the companies that define this layer now will define how the agentic economy works for decades. We intend to be that foundation.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#A8A8A8]">
                            Early stage. Based in Germany. Building for the industries where failure has consequences.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pt-4">
                            <a
                                href="mailto:hello@kyde.com"
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#1F1F1F] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#A8A8A8] hover:border-[#2E2E2E] hover:text-[#F2F2F2] transition-all"
                            >
                                hello@kyde.com
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <Footer />
</Base>
